and by running you get results

00:34:49.639 --> 00:34:51.639
you get a whole report

00:34:51.639 --> 00:34:53.639
that this is in this metric

00:34:53.639 --> 00:34:55.639
this is in this metric

00:34:55.639 --> 00:34:57.640
this is more than that

00:34:57.640 --> 00:34:59.640
so by running this whole regression testing

00:34:59.640 --> 00:35:01.640
you get a very clear picture

00:35:01.640 --> 00:35:03.640
so the new version of the software

00:35:03.640 --> 00:35:05.640
we have made

00:35:05.640 --> 00:35:07.640
is it objectively better than the previous version

